# TOEIC Vocabulary — Day41

## 오늘의 단어 5개

| Word          | Meaning | Example                              |
| ------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------ |
| negotiate     | 협상하다    | We need to negotiate the contract.   |
| contract      | 계약      | They signed a new contract.          |
| expense       | 비용, 지출  | Travel expenses will be reimbursed.  |
| reimbursement | 환급, 상환  | Employees can request reimbursement. |
| invoice       | 송장, 청구서 | Please check the invoice carefully.  |

---

## 1. negotiate

협상하다

> The two companies are **negotiating** a new contract.

### 자주 나오는 표현

* negotiate a contract
* negotiate a price
* negotiate with a client

---

## 2. contract

계약

> The company signed a three-year **contract**.

### 함께 기억

* sign a contract = 계약을 체결하다
* renew a contract = 계약을 갱신하다
* terminate a contract = 계약을 종료하다

---

## 3. expense

비용 / 지출

> Business **expenses** must be reported.

### 자주 나오는 표현

* travel expenses
* business expenses
* operating expenses

---

## 4. reimbursement

환급 / 상환

> Employees can request **reimbursement** for travel expenses.

→ 직원들은 출장비 환급을 요청할 수 있다.

---

## 5. invoice

송장 / 청구서

> The supplier sent us an **invoice**.

### 함께 기억

* issue an invoice = 청구서를 발행하다
* pay an invoice = 청구서를 지불하다
* check an invoice = 청구서를 확인하다

---

## 오늘의 핵심 연결

> **negotiate → contract → invoice → expense → reimbursement**

회사 업무에서 자주 연결되어 등장하는 단어들이다.

---

## Quick Review

* negotiate = 협상하다
* contract = 계약
* expense = 비용
* reimbursement = 환급
* invoice = 청구서
